Khaime se Aarahi hai Sada Ya Ali(a.s) Ya Ali(a.s) Ya Ali(a.s) Madad</p>

<p>6. Sughra ka khat hai aur hai Akbar(a.s) ka janaaza<br />
ab isse bada Shaah pa gham kounsa hoga<br />
laashe pe khat ko rakhke Ya Ali(a.s) Madad<br />
Khaime se Aarahi hai Sada Ya Ali(a.s) Ya Ali(a.s) Ya Ali(a.s) Madad</p>

<p>7. Maatam hai Bapa Ashk bhi aankho'n se hai jaari<br />
Asghar(a.s) ke gham me doobi hai ye <b>Asghari</b> saari<br />
